- The ``method_name`` argument of ``fields.Method`` has been renamed to ``serialize``.

``func`` and ``method_name`` are still present for backwards-compatibility, but they will both be removed in marshmallow 3.0.

2.2.1 (2015-11-11)
------------------

Bug fixes:

